    "title": "Surgical and Oncologic Outcomes of Robotic and Conventional Nipple-Sparing Mastectomy with Immediate Reconstruction: International Multicenter Pooled Data Analysis",
    "authors": "Hyung Seok Park, MD, PhD1, Jeea Lee, MD2, Hung-Wen Lai, MD, PhD3,4,5, Jung Mi Park, BSc6, Jai Min Ryu, MD, PhD7, Jeong Eon Lee, MD, PhD7, Jee Ye Kim, MD1, Emilia Marrazzo, MD8, Alessandra Margherita De Scalzi, MD9, Giovanni Corso, MD, PhD9,10, Filippo Montemurro, MD11, Guglielmo Gazzetta, MD11, Giada Pozzi, MD11, and Antonio Toesca, MD11",
